   "description": "Counting unit on this dashboard: ONE ATTACK = ONE CrowdSec ALERT = one IP tripping one scenario (e.g. probing 10 sensitive paths within seconds). One attack is typically 5-50 requests. From CrowdSec's own alert DB, so correct regardless of Prometheus history.",
